"parameters of ``-netdev tap`` disables script execution.  This special "
"treatment of ``\"no\"`` is deprecated.  Use an empty string (``script=`` or "
"``downscript=``) to disable script execution instead.  In a future version, "
"``\"no\"`` will be treated as a plain file name."
